flowchart TB
  student[Student browser]
  frontend[Next.js frontend<br/>Pills, Markdown reader, previews, optional materials]
  api[FastAPI<br/>Authorization, source selection, job API, scoped chat, exports]
  redis[(Redis<br/>Celery task broker)]
  workers[Celery workers<br/>Ingestion, complete-source synthesis, validation, rendering, export]
  mongo[(MongoDB + Vector Search<br/>Users, Pills, source references, jobs, chunks, embeddings)]
  objects[(Object storage<br/>Originals, parsed JSON, Markdown, PNG assets, export ZIP)]
  docling[Docling<br/>Documents, images, layout, OCR]
  whisper[FFmpeg + faster-whisper<br/>Whisper small open weights<br/>Timestamped audio transcription]
  llm[Ollama model server<br/>Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct open weights]
  embeddings[Embedding runtime<br/>Open-weight embedding model<br/>Exact model to be selected]
  student --> frontend
  frontend <-->|HTTPS requests, job polling, authorized artifacts| api
  api -->|Enqueue task with job ID and source snapshot| redis
  redis -->|Deliver task| workers
  workers -->|Acknowledge / bounded retry| redis
  api <-->|Authorize, save metadata, read status, scoped retrieval| mongo
  workers <-->|Persist stages, source chunks, vectors, results| mongo
  api <-->|Uploads and authorized artifact access| objects
  workers <-->|Read originals; write parsed data and generated artifacts| objects
  workers --> docling
  workers --> whisper
  workers <-->|Section synthesis and selected extras| llm
  workers -->|Embed source chunks| embeddings
  api -.->|Grounded chat generation| llm
  api -.->|Embed chat query| embeddings
